<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48393" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tinnŭlus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>ringing</i>, <i>tinkling</i>, <i>shrill-sounding</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-Aug. prose). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sistra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					P. 1, 1, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					4, 393</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chordae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Troad. 833</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fistula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 4, 74</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					61, 13</span></i>
			; Pompon. ap. <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 6, 4</span></i>
			(with tenuis): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illic cymbala tinnulaeque Gades,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the shrill noise of the Gaditan maidens</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 1, 6, 71</span></i>
			 (cf. <i><span class="en">Juv. 11, 162</span></i>).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of speakers: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(rhetores) tumidi et corrupti et tinnuli,</span>”
				<i>jingling</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					2, 3, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 143, 2</span></i>
			; cf. tinnitus, II.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
